127	/// Shared KV backing storage with page-based allocation.
128	///
129	/// Owns a single GPU buffer in page-first layout: each page is a contiguous
130	/// chunk holding all layers' K and V for `page_size` tokens.
131	///
132	/// ```text
133	/// page_i: [L0_K | L0_V | L1_K | L1_V | ... | Ln_K | Ln_V]
134	///          └─ page_size × num_kv_heads × head_dim each ─┘
135	/// ```
136	///
137	/// Cheaply cloneable (Arc). Multiple `KvState`s share the same pool.
